# ztOSCoreSensorFramework on the Pixel 3a XL: the pieces this phone really runs.
# The GSI ships the Galaxy S9's list (zrn_* modules, the sensor hub, the Samsung
# modem), which fails at every boot here. kind|id|argument|title, in start order.
#
#   module   a kernel module with no service of its own
#   unit     a systemd unit that keeps its own process alive
#   session  a program of the user's session: watched, not started
unit|rmtfs.service||Modem storage (rmtfs)
unit|tqftpserv.service||Modem files (tqftpserv)
unit|hexagonrpcd-adsp-rootpd.service||ADSP FastRPC (root)
unit|hexagonrpcd-adsp-sensorspd.service||Sensor DSP (FastRPC)
unit|bluetooth.service||Bluetooth
unit|zrnperfd.service||Performance
session|ztapps||App list
